ied by eGFR. The sensory system was proxied by olfactory system performance. The digestive system was proxied by hepatic unbound clearance. Fluid and crystallized intelligence were proxied by WAIS scores. The musculoskeletal system was proxied by ankle dorsiflexion force-control. All proxies are based on limited but high-quality studies and are presented for illustrative purposes rather than as precise quantitative estimates.","sourcePDFSha256":"5aa7975ffb8d279ff9c9ae264ccdbac37071cd99b714f3bd4189992e0a554c5d","licence":"CC BY"},{"href":"/assets/papers/cv-032/figure-02.webp","width":1801,"height":610,"bytes":67124,"sha256":"9116604eb4e3d462e5e23074f5eebc674253dfd1a1f9537d7076da40359fe68e","figureNumber":2,"page":7,"cropPDFPoints":[63.0,72.0,552.5499877929688,237.5],"legendFirstSentence":"Mapping Peakspan Within Lifespan and Healthspan and Integrating Multiscale Data Into Multimodal Foundation Models.","legendSourceText":"Figure 2. Mapping Peakspan Within Lifespan and Healthspan and Integrating Multiscale Data Into Multimodal Foundation Models.","sourcePDFSha256":"5aa7975ffb8d279ff9c9ae264ccdbac37071cd99b714f3bd4189992e0a554c5d","licence":"CC BY"}],"readingWidth":2048,"loupe":{"mode":"magnify-same-image","factor":2},"figureStatus":"extracted from source PDF","bytes":{"pdf":0,"pages":2876254,"figures":163908,"total":3040162},"buildId":"f23bc85995440832e2b6","licenceLine":"Copyright: © 2026 Zhavoronkov A. et al. This is an open-access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution License, which permits unrestricted use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original author and source are credited.","sourceModifiedUTC":"2026-11-19T04:30:49.261022+00:00","identity":{"titleOnPage1":true,"yingOnPage1":true}}
